{"id": "86309", "name": "מקדמים קבועים הומוגנית – פתרון כללי, שורשים ממשיים שונים (ב) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} - {{CT:1}} \\frac{dy}{dx} - {{CT:2}} y = 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Use A and B for the arbitrary constants.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(y(x) =\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.92em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">Warning: ensure you write <code dir=\"ltr\">A*e^()</code>, <code dir=\"ltr\">A*exp()</code>, <code dir=\"ltr\">A*cos()</code> or <code dir=\"ltr\">A*sin()</code> to avoid misinterpretation.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Substitute \\(y=e^{mx}\\) to get the auxiliary equation; its two distinct real roots give the general solution.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The auxiliary equation</b><br>To solve the differential equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} - {{CT:1}} \\frac{dy}{dx} - {{CT:2}} y = 0 \\]</p>Let \\(y = e^{mx}\\) and hence \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=me^{mx}\\) and \\(\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = m^2e^{mx}\\). Substituting for \\(y\\) gives<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}m^2e^{mx} - {{CT:1}}me^{mx} - {{CT:2}}e^{mx} = 0 \\]</p>and dividing throughout by \\(e^{mx}\\) (never zero) and {{CT:3}} gives the auxiliary (characteristic) equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ m^2 - {{CT:4}}m - {{CT:5}} = 0 \\]</p>which can be solved using the quadratic formula to give {{CT:6}}: two distinct real roots.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The general solution</b><br>For two distinct real roots the functions \\(e^{m_1x}\\) and \\(e^{m_2x}\\) are linearly independent solutions, so the solution is then of the form<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y = A{{CT:7}}+B{{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "stu_lhs:ev(n1*diff(ans1,x,2)-bc*diff(ans1,x)-cc*ans1,simp);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "altanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu_lhs", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer solves the differential equation but is either not the most general soloution or does not use the prescribed constants \"A\" and \"B\".</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["altanswer", "bc", "cc", "correctanswer", "m", "m1", "m2", "n1", "n2", "n3", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2", "wronganswer3"], "nvariants": 50}